"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RK_A_OUTSIDE_POLICE_NUMBER2_RK_DETECTED_ATTACK\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"All at once, they power up their weapons (which seem tailored to destroy RK ships), eject an auxiliary ship with big engines and cannons, which quickly goes some distance away to provide artillery support, and a sudden explosion also makes your ears ring.\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThey must have used some sort of combat augment on your Engines!\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tThese guys don't mess around. You quickly prepare to fight!"

