"\t\t\t\t\n"
"\t\t\t\tThey are somehow jamming your jump drive too! You'll have to fight them to leave, as the RadiKals don't seem willing to pick a side here."

#: src-en/data/events.xml.append:4539
msgid ""
"data/events.xml.append$//event[@name=\"RKS_EXIT_PIRATE_TRINITY_AMBUSH\"]/choice/event/choice/text"
